# Frontend: Feature-Driven Structure

All new frontend work lives under `frontend/` using domain modules. **Do not** dump domain UI into `components/` or put business logic in `app/`.

## Layout (canonical)

```text
frontend/
├── public/
├── src/
│   ├── app/                    # Routing & pages ONLY (thin)
│   │   ├── (auth)/             # login, signup + auth layout
│   │   ├── (dashboard)/        # authenticated app routes
│   │   ├── api/                # Route handlers only when needed
│   │   ├── layout.tsx
│   │   ├── page.tsx
│   │   ├── providers.tsx
│   │   ├── error.tsx | loading.tsx | not-found.tsx
│   ├── actions/                # Shared server actions (or colocate in features/)
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── ui/                 # Primitives (Button, Input, Badge)
│   │   └── common/             # Header, Footer, Sidebar
│   ├── features/               # Domain modules (preferred home for logic)
│   │   └── <domain>/           # e.g. auth, profile, cv, matches
│   │       ├── api/
│   │       ├── components/
│   │       ├── hooks/
│   │       ├── types/
│   │       └── utils/
│   ├── hooks/                  # Shared hooks only
│   ├── lib/                    # Amplify, API client, SDK wrappers (AWS only)
│   ├── styles/                 # globals.css, Tailwind overrides
│   ├── types/
│   └── utils/                  # Pure helpers (cn, formatters)
├── middleware.ts
└── …
```

## Placement rules

| Put here | Do not put here |
| --- | --- |
| `app/**/page.tsx` — compose feature components | Forms, hooks, Amplify calls, API logic |
| `features/<domain>/` — domain UI, hooks, types, API | Generic Button/Input (use `components/ui`) |
| `components/ui` + `common` — reusable, domain-agnostic | Auth forms, profile editors, job cards |
| `lib/` — Amplify config, `fetch` to Serverless API | Feature-specific parsers |

## Job Scout domains (add as features land)

`auth` · `profile` · `cv` · `matches` (job matching) · `scheduler`

## Imports

- Prefer `@/features/<domain>/...`, `@/components/ui/...`, `@/lib/...`
- Route groups `(auth)` / `(dashboard)` must **not** change public URLs (`/login`, `/signup`, `/settings`)
- No Prisma/Stripe/Vercel — use Amplify Cognito + Serverless API under `lib/`

## ❌ Bad / ✅ Good

```text
❌ src/components/auth/SignInForm.tsx
✅ src/features/auth/components/SignInForm.tsx

❌ src/app/login/SignInForm.tsx
✅ src/app/(auth)/login/page.tsx  → imports from features/auth
```
